// half, or the giant's own sun close by - at q27..q29 from it, radius q30,
// q31 kelvin. Their colour over what is behind them and how much of that
// they cover; coronas, as `glow`, only where nothing nearer is in front.
vec4 featured(vec3 rd, float pix, out vec3 glow) {
